sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant EX as feed.events
    participant V as Verification
    participant M as Market Data
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant CR as Credibility
    participant KG as Neo4j

    EX->>V: verification.predictions receives PredictionMade
    V->>PG: Store pending outcome idempotently
    V->>V: Resolve baseline and settlement sessions
    V->>PG: Persist scheduled evaluation and outbox event
    V->>EX: price.requested with both sessions
    EX->>M: market-data.price-requests
    M->>PG: Persist request before acknowledgement
    Note over M: Pending work is rehydrated after restart
    M->>M: Fetch both approved reference closes under registry and roll policy
    M->>PG: Store baseline and settlement observations
    M->>EX: price.observed
    EX->>V: verification.prices
    V->>V: Calculate close-to-close return and deadband
    V->>PG: Atomically store score and outbox event
    V->>EX: prediction.scored
    EX->>CR: credibility.scored
    CR->>PG: Check processed-prediction ledger
    alt Already processed
        CR->>CR: Acknowledge without update
    else New score
        CR->>CR: Update edge, arbiter, and source-utility targets separately
        CR->>KG: Apply directional edge updates
        CR->>PG: Commit history and processed ledger
    end
